                                                    {activeObstacles.length} Active Obstacle{activeObstacles.length === 1 ? '' : 's'}
                                                </span>
                                            )}
                                        </div>
                                        <p className="text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500 mt-0.5">
                                            Search equipment, rooms, or areas to log operational delays, apply downtime categories, and track &apos;Proper Setup&apos; signoffs.
