                                        {gtStatus.obstacle === 'found' ? tr('Shared with every computer', 'Compartido con todas las computadoras')
                                            : gtStatus.obstacle === 'missing' ? tr('This computer only: the _g_ Obstacle table is not made yet', 'Solo esta computadora: la tabla _g_ Obstacle aun no existe')
                                            : gtStatus.obstacle === 'denied' ? tr('This computer only: no permission on _g_ Obstacle', 'Solo esta computadora: sin permiso en _g_ Obstacle')
                                            : gtStatus.obstacle ? tr('This computer only: _g_ Obstacle could not be read', 'Solo esta computadora: no se pudo leer _g_ Obstacle')
                                            : tr('Checking the _g_ Obstacle table...', 'Revisando la tabla _g_ Obstacle...')}
                                    </span>
